    "title": "Man impaled by stick at Old Furnace State Park, airlifted to hospital - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Zoe Strothers ,\n1 days ago KILLINGLY, Conn. (WFSB) - A man is being transported by medical helicopter after being impaled by a stick at Old Furnace State Park. According to CT Department of Energy & Environmental Protection, emergency crews are currently working on getting the 49-year-old man out of the woods to be taken by LifeStar to the hospital. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
